=============================================================
 DRAINGUARD
 Autonomous Robotic System for Stormwater Drain Inspection
 and Blockage Detection

 Hardware:
 - Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32S3 Sense
 - Camera
 - BME280
 - Water/Moisture Sensor
 - MQ Gas Sensor
 - Distance Sensor
 - Battery Monitor
 - Motor Driver
 - Trained Edge Impulse ML Model

 Features:
 - Custom Web Dashboard
 - Camera Snapshot Feed
 - ML Blockage Detection
 - Sensor Monitoring
 - Robot Control
 - Automatic Hazard Alerts
 - Live Telemetry API

=============================================================
*/

